# Build context for Reproducibility/docker-images. Keep bulk and irrelevant
# paths out of the context sent to the Docker daemon. LabData/, Controls/,
# Custom Packages/, quarterCutoff/, Reproducibility/Scripts/ and renv.lock are
# deliberately NOT ignored — the Dockerfiles COPY from them.

.git
.Rproj.user
.cache
.config
.local
renv/
Outputs/
FinalSet/
FinalSet.zip
cases/
BaseData/
Explainer/
Statistics/
Reproducibility/Outputs/
Reproducibility/Methylation Analysis Dockerfiles/
**/.DS_Store
**/.Rhistory
**/.RData
